('025182', '1456a3e2-60a6-4be7-8c1e-f53008a6aa28', '826', 'Contemporary Public Policy Issues', 'Offers a general primer on large-scale policies directed by US federal and state governments, with specific examples in pressing policy areas. Takes existing policies and the policy process as a given, explains them in detail, and puts a policy focus on very specific contemporary questions of concern to policymakers. Gain a broad overall knowledge of how the majority of state and federal funding is spent and the policy outcomes associated with that spending. ', 'None', 'C', 'PUB AFFR 200', 'PUBLIC AFFAIRS AND PUBLIC POLICY 200', 3, 3, NULL, NULL, 'S', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'E', 'Not Applicable', NULL, 'Student Option', 'N', 'N', 200, 2),
