('231', 'The WSB has standardized the waitlist process.  Students looking to access a closed class should put their name on the waitlist and waitlists will be processed on a first-come first-served basis.  The only exception is GEN BUS 306, for which business students will be given priority.  If you need assistance adding yourself to the waitlist or if you wish to request an exception to the first-come, first-served process, please use this link to request permission: 
         https://go.wisc.edu/busenroll 

Please note that any requests for an exception to the first-come, first-served waitlist processing will be verified through advising.  

All undergraduate Business courses are restricted to admitted Business students and Certificate in Business students declared prior to Spring 2025 (does not include Certificates in Entrepreneurship, Consulting, Accounting Fundamentals, Risk Management and Insurance, or Summer Certificate in Business Fundamentals) until 8 AM (CST) May 1, 2025 for fall enrollment and 8 AM (CST) December 9, 2025 for spring enrollment, unless otherwise noted. GEN BUS 310 and GEN BUS 311 are not restricted.

Certificate in Business students declared after Spring 2025 will gain access to ACCT I S 100, M H R 300, FINANCE 300, MARKETNG 300, OTM 300, REAL EST 306, and R M I 300 at least 3 days prior to the noted open enrollment date. Spring 2026 enrollment date for CIB is December 4, 2025.'),
